{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>華潤建材科技發盈警，料截至9月底九個月將轉盈為虧，最多蝕8.5億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>主要由於混凝土、骨料及水泥價格下降，以及煤炭價格上漲影響，導致綜合毛利及綜合毛利率減少。上一年度同期，集團錄得純利3.31億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T00:59:19.781927+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T00:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T01:17:55.079924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T00:57:41.053078+00:00","content_hash":"ff8917d5bf1880a7a397e726873999f344575d90485abba400073d4b050c8a59","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}